### The launcher
Create `plugin/scripts/atm` (POSIX sh, executable):
- if `python3` ≥ 3.9 is on `PATH`, run `atm.py`;
- else if `node` ≥ 18, run `atm.mjs`;
- else print what to install and exit `127`.

`ATM_RUNTIME=python|node` forces one (used by tests; an error if that runtime is missing).

